### Setup simulation

region bounding_region sphere 0.0 0.0 0.0 ${radius} units box
region bounding_region sphere 0.0 0.0 0.0 2 units box

lattice sc ${lattice_const} origin 0.0 0.0 0.0
lattice sc 0.4 origin 0.0 0.0 0.0
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 0.4 0.4 0.4

create_box 2 bounding_region
